<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Message attachments let you send files in channel messages and private messages. A message can contain text, one or more files, or both."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_choose_file}>{dgettext("help_features", "Sending")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Use the attachment button in the chat input, choose a file, wait for the upload to finish, then send the message."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_file_send}>{dgettext("help_features", "Previews")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Image attachments render as inline thumbnails. Audio and video attachments are played back in the message, PDF files expose a preview action, and other files render as safe file cards with type, size and path metadata."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Unsafe browser-rendered formats, including SVG and HTML, are kept as downloadable files instead of inline previews."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_play}>{dgettext("help_features", "Playing Sound and Video")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Audio and video are played back in a small media player that looks like Hex Radio. Its display shows the name, the elapsed time and the length, the spectrum of a sound, and a slider to jump to another moment."
  )}
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The buttons under the display play the sound, pause it where it is, and stop it at the start"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_features", "The mute button turns the sound off without stopping it")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "A video has one more button, which fills the screen; Esc goes back"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Only one sound is heard at a time. Starting a new sound puts the old one on pause and switches Hex Radio off"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_folder}>{dgettext("help_features", "File Paths")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Uploaded files are stored with a logical directory path so administrators can browse them later without depending on the storage bucket's internal object keys."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_shield}>{dgettext("help_features", "Access")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Downloads are authorized by the chat server first. If access is allowed, the server redirects to a short-lived signed storage URL."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="formatting-overview">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Text Formatting")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-url-catcher">
    {dgettext("help_features", "URL Catcher")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-voice-messages">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Voice Messages")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="ui-hex-radio">Hex Radio</.help_link>
</p>
